; expect: terminates. The guard pins x to 1 where any x reaches l1 (facts.ts): the value fixed by a guard is a comparison
; kept, not a fact at l1 (x = 1 read as a fact of l1 would let the rule fire at every x, forever).
(format LCTRS)
(theory Ints)
(fun l0 (-> Int Int))
(fun l1 (-> Int Int))
(entrypoint l0)
(rule (l0 x) (l1 x))
(rule (l1 x) (l1 (+ x 1)) :guard (= 1 x))
